{"screen_name": "Poe_M_Art", "file": "Poe_M_Art", "name": "PoeMArt", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1570576851004801026/g704yZYH.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1461204538422083586/1663693477/1500x500", "description": "Fan/cms Art Only rest in →🦋                                  \n\nvgen: https://vgen.co/PoeMArt          \n    \nnew account: @MossyFishes", "total_works": 83, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-14T18:37:17.360468+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 2500, "recorded_at": "2026-02-14T13:18:32.161722+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 2500}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 2500, "max": 2500}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/_PoeM_Art", "name": "_PoeM_Art"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://vgen.co/PoeMArt", "name": ""}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/83", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7ed728d7/uploads/origins/9c601415-895c-4a27-bc25-3a53a1e46480?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf44118a17b9f5a8e4e29ddb94c2e15a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7ed728d7/uploads/origins/9c601415-895c-4a27-bc25-3a53a1e46480?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf44118a17b9f5a8e4e29ddb94c2e15a, https://si.imgix.net/7ed728d7/uploads/origins/9c601415-895c-4a27-bc25-3a53a1e46480?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8bb8719ed282d6d17f74e39c8fe6f45b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7ed728d7/uploads/origins/9c601415-895c-4a27-bc25-3a53a1e46480?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df7a2a6a7d50888cacfd0cfe6c944bf0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好我喜欢你的艺术！我想用你的跳跃赤壁风格来创作我的角色！\n\n哈特是龙的混血儿，外表冷漠，但热情而混乱。他弹着一把电吉他，这把吉他也可以作为他的武器。他喜欢勘察未开发的地形，并花很多时间玩音乐。他有黑色的头发和绿色的眼睛。身高 174 厘米。\n\n主题：音乐设备和 CD、技术、末世后的城市与杂草丛生的树叶、故障、漂浮的 HUD 面板，整体审美类似于 Arknight\n\n构图和诠释由您决定。请自由发挥！  谢谢！\n\nhttps://www.notion.so/vani0x0/Hitori-Hart-Hart-280509103a5180eab81cc439d3b39c2f", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/82", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b014c1c2/uploads/origins/bc25facb-6b60-4655-b288-3f61e4a111ae?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e352b621484d1e5b12733eeab4c0ebc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b014c1c2/uploads/origins/bc25facb-6b60-4655-b288-3f61e4a111ae?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e352b621484d1e5b12733eeab4c0ebc, https://si.imgix.net/b014c1c2/uploads/origins/bc25facb-6b60-4655-b288-3f61e4a111ae?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b78fa122e2af653aabd7f84daa93bbe 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b014c1c2/uploads/origins/bc25facb-6b60-4655-b288-3f61e4a111ae?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e32b0a65618d0da3653ecc06e4bb9fb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! Nice to meet you, and thank you so much for the lovely compliment! ♡\n\nI'm really happy that you praised my OC Shiranui-san and showed interest in drawing him!\nI'd absolutely love to request a chibi illustration of my OC.\n\nPoeMArt-sama’s chibi artworks are incredibly beautiful and cute, and among them, this framed-art style piece is especially wonderful:\nhttps://skeb.jp/@Poe_M_Art/works/75\n\nIf you would be willing to draw Shiranui-san in this framed-art style, I would be thrilled!\n\nHere is the folder with his references:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1M4Yd2lBK6RoEVqsX_eUdQSuPi6265Wkp\n\nThank you so much for this wonderful opportunity.\nI would be very grateful if you could consider my request (*ᴗˬᴗ)♡", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/81", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9031e63a/uploads/origins/edab0ed9-726d-492c-9b76-17403356df04?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48f96fb9b47aae340398494867d77b22", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9031e63a/uploads/origins/edab0ed9-726d-492c-9b76-17403356df04?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48f96fb9b47aae340398494867d77b22, https://si.imgix.net/9031e63a/uploads/origins/edab0ed9-726d-492c-9b76-17403356df04?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6cc62346857dfc7be79ce069a008558e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9031e63a/uploads/origins/edab0ed9-726d-492c-9b76-17403356df04?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8c48d9fbd11ba2a915cfeb95775d1fb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好，我是来响应一项呼吁的。您能为我画一个以《爱丽丝梦游仙境》中的疯帽子为原型的玩偶角色吗？我想要一个赤壁动画。如果可能的话，请画一个可以看到她整个身体的姿势。我把姿势和面部表情留给您的创意。\n\nhttps://imgchest.com/p/qb4zjpoxvyj", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/80", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9587f612/uploads/origins/29d131e7-6aeb-4259-99b8-a87a265f572b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=361ccc354d1bb4fa33696b01a006ed0c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9587f612/uploads/origins/29d131e7-6aeb-4259-99b8-a87a265f572b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=361ccc354d1bb4fa33696b01a006ed0c, https://si.imgix.net/9587f612/uploads/origins/29d131e7-6aeb-4259-99b8-a87a265f572b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e5a04c19bdf4d98d44315318946ca4af 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9587f612/uploads/origins/29d131e7-6aeb-4259-99b8-a87a265f572b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=38df27f1b301307ba9bd8544f25a463a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/79", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/50dc3d9b/uploads/origins/20ea6c89-8900-4cb8-af24-57b69f03a7a7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87e602ddffbf58d01aec11ece39f6e0f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/50dc3d9b/uploads/origins/20ea6c89-8900-4cb8-af24-57b69f03a7a7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87e602ddffbf58d01aec11ece39f6e0f, https://si.imgix.net/50dc3d9b/uploads/origins/20ea6c89-8900-4cb8-af24-57b69f03a7a7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69b93ba7e69ea59b58413c6895dc6c90 2x, https://si.imgix.net/50dc3d9b/uploads/origins/20ea6c89-8900-4cb8-af24-57b69f03a7a7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea2957d43b6458d217cb06f71fdfd00e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Dear PoeMArt \nNice to meet you, my name is Nyoki \nThank you for your appeal!\nI saw your work and it was very nice. \n\nI would like you to draw my favorite Vtuber, Yosei-chan. \n\n [Usage] \n- I would like to present it to Yosei-chan as fan art. \nI would appreciate it if you would allow me to use it in her distribution activities. \n\n[Details of the illustration Details of the illustration】 \n・Please leave the composition to me!\nWe would like you to draw the illustration as you like!\nPlease leave the composition to us! We would like you to draw it as you like! If possible, we would appreciate it if you could provide us with PSD data with separate layers or transparent data so that we can use only the characters. \n\n[Illustration for reference] \nWe will share it with you on Google Drive. \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1T9YPrcXXRgsGLG0MeVqfYcLiIfaIAr3F \n\n\nWe hope you will consider the above contents. We would appreciate it if you could consider our proposal.\nThank you very much.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1T9YPrcXXRgsGLG0MeVqfYcLiIfaIAr3F", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/78", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e9bb240b/uploads/origins/4323f46b-e87e-4956-ad47-b18704aa7c4c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1ac58b16fa4789f7c03e4eb465133c1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e9bb240b/uploads/origins/4323f46b-e87e-4956-ad47-b18704aa7c4c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1ac58b16fa4789f7c03e4eb465133c1, https://si.imgix.net/e9bb240b/uploads/origins/4323f46b-e87e-4956-ad47-b18704aa7c4c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0903e9893ab931837bd2b2466b7bf738 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e9bb240b/uploads/origins/4323f46b-e87e-4956-ad47-b18704aa7c4c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0858237a72f44714be3e5c48a0ec7838 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、先生！先生のイラストが大好きです！\n\n私のOC \"C \"と友達のOC \"Thursday \"のかわいいチビをリクエストしたいです！\n\nC:\n- キツネの突然変異で、先が赤い大きなキツネの耳、先が赤い2本のキツネの尻尾、牙、赤い瞳孔、目の下に赤いマーキングがある。\n- 右目の下と口の左にほくろ、左頬と左眉に傷跡がある。\n- ツンデレ、短気だが根は優しい、落ち込んでいる、木曜日に恋をしているが恥ずかしい。\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1wRKXEd7-RAOU05owimsggwIfXnijvDH6/view?usp=drive_link\n\n木曜日：\n- 半透明のゼリー状の左腕と右前腕を持つ。\n- 無感情、優しい、とても \"普通 \"の人格、Cに恋しているが気づいていない（Cのしっぽもとても好き！）。\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1H2gjr4eUh2_8sflPmHAyHyelFbmZAXW1/view?usp=drive_link\n\nどちらも2種類のデザインがありますので、お好きな方をお使いください！リクエストにお答えいただきありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CdSLDrOBPdO_4lyjRll7bp76BKYfFmZt?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/77", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/74bf57ab/uploads/origins/c68a8f75-b6b6-4895-9fad-4d5f0b673dc2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20b49d4984bcb3dde50c3343f23cc2a9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74bf57ab/uploads/origins/c68a8f75-b6b6-4895-9fad-4d5f0b673dc2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20b49d4984bcb3dde50c3343f23cc2a9, https://si.imgix.net/74bf57ab/uploads/origins/c68a8f75-b6b6-4895-9fad-4d5f0b673dc2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68e16e25bb05d161ef839fb212cd3a11 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74bf57ab/uploads/origins/c68a8f75-b6b6-4895-9fad-4d5f0b673dc2?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2533cd5db2052bed5caa06958f88fb63 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you! Thank you for giving me the appeal!\n\nYour art is very appealing and I would like you to draw my character!\nMy charm point is my ribbon braided hair and a mole under the right eye!\nMy favorite colors are light blue and white.\n\nI will use the illustration you draw for my social networking and streaming activities.\nIf possible, I would like a transparent file of the person only.\n\nI will send you the URL of the character's reference material, so please feel free to draw the composition, clothing, etc!\nI look forward to seeing the finished product.\n\n\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1G_IeJGHO5umDvE9IYoUwiCiMi-He7-T6?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/76", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/076c92f4/uploads/origins/25939115-e8c8-4701-b6d1-cb3ef9e9db2c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5908ad7b3d8e71314ff3959097c8f7b1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/076c92f4/uploads/origins/25939115-e8c8-4701-b6d1-cb3ef9e9db2c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5908ad7b3d8e71314ff3959097c8f7b1, https://si.imgix.net/076c92f4/uploads/origins/25939115-e8c8-4701-b6d1-cb3ef9e9db2c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b32c096addf4d09cdd1a29ae0177254e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/076c92f4/uploads/origins/25939115-e8c8-4701-b6d1-cb3ef9e9db2c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6045d4a65f7860e7df6307afec8b8bfa 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私の友人と私はあなたの作品がとても好きで、私たちのOCペアを描いていただけたら嬉しいです！\n\nK (177 cm)\nスカンク・ミュータント\nKは下品で、熱血で、短気で、対立的。しかし、自信家で、保護欲が強く、正直でもある。清潔好き。エレキギターとドラムを演奏する。白髪、灰色の目。\n\nスミ（168センチ）\n鯉の突然変異体\nのんびり屋で、陽気で、遊び好きで、いたずら好き。ポジティブなエネルギーにあふれ、いつも笑顔。ドラムを叩きます。鯉の模様の髪と黄色い目。服装は'OUTFITS'フォルダを参照してください。\n\n二人は幸せに付き合っている。須美はKをからかったり、パーソナルスペースに入り込んだり、愛情のシャワーを浴びせたりして楽しんでいる。Kはそんな須美の態度にイライラしているが、2人は一緒にいることを楽しみ、心から愛し合っている。そんな2人を自由に描いてください！\n\nありがとうございました\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hSKXZSY5B5wDkV4zhPi8Ce0EUYQjvDS8", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/75", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c7af9f73/uploads/origins/d7cba2cf-385f-457c-a218-da71a50f5691?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=831f21fad7d4f41f14b119b450ee2bdd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c7af9f73/uploads/origins/d7cba2cf-385f-457c-a218-da71a50f5691?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=831f21fad7d4f41f14b119b450ee2bdd, https://si.imgix.net/c7af9f73/uploads/origins/d7cba2cf-385f-457c-a218-da71a50f5691?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=659770a3d56d570f03226a3f1eb9de3b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c7af9f73/uploads/origins/d7cba2cf-385f-457c-a218-da71a50f5691?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fbff78d919e1440b75dcbf42c82700e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, nice to meet you. My name is Kozuki Hakua.\nI received your message regarding commissions, and I would like to kindly send a request as I would love to work with you!\n\nThe illustration I would like to request is of myself as a VTuber.\nI have outlined the details of my request below, and I would appreciate it if you could review them.\n\n[Details]\nThis illustration will be used for my streaming activities.\nIf possible, I would be very happy if you could create both versions of me—one with wolf ears and one without.\nI will send you the URL of my X (formerly Twitter) account, so please refer to the image in the pinned tweet.\n\nAs for the expression, I would appreciate it if you could make it so that my canine teeth are visible.\nFor the composition, I leave it to your discretion.\n\nI apologize for the lengthy message, but I would be very grateful for your consideration.\nThank you very much, and I look forward to hearing from you!\n\nhttps://x.com/K_Hakua1_6", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/74", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/54c491c6/uploads/origins/130940b9-b535-4ea3-bc45-fce227f74df6?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fb52638f2959b48706b8f70e327c5524", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/54c491c6/uploads/origins/130940b9-b535-4ea3-bc45-fce227f74df6?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fb52638f2959b48706b8f70e327c5524, https://si.imgix.net/54c491c6/uploads/origins/130940b9-b535-4ea3-bc45-fce227f74df6?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2d6adc87458881fc54c92ad2a66b09e3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/54c491c6/uploads/origins/130940b9-b535-4ea3-bc45-fce227f74df6?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7cf03a64af895f3939e77c72ba6960ef 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/73", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3818be6f/uploads/origins/5fbb1684-82c3-48d3-a3c7-80a9e4906f5f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=566339c815c009f7e716e3c5eb604237", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3818be6f/uploads/origins/5fbb1684-82c3-48d3-a3c7-80a9e4906f5f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=566339c815c009f7e716e3c5eb604237, https://si.imgix.net/3818be6f/uploads/origins/5fbb1684-82c3-48d3-a3c7-80a9e4906f5f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6fa9123cf45d2d86193356b2111c5372 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3818be6f/uploads/origins/5fbb1684-82c3-48d3-a3c7-80a9e4906f5f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d73cec56d106e2f6e09a2f27e62246bf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Poe-san.\nThanks for sending me an appeal.\n\n Sakura  Haruno (@hare_sakula) is playing dragon quest 3(Dragon Warrior III) bound and I would like to announce my support FA.\nWe would like you to create an image of Sakura as a brave warrior.\n\nWe would like to present that work to the artist as an FA.\nTherefore, we would like to ask for permission to use the work in our activities (thumbnails, SNS, distribution).\nCould I please get the PSD file with separate layers as well?\n\nPlease refer to the following URL.\n (https://x.com/hare_sakula/status/1696336333437116889)\n\nhttps://x.com/hare_sakula/status/1696336333437116889", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/72", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/19fc8afd/uploads/origins/8899fa16-0b6f-4183-ad7f-8369c4f06134?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4d1c291df79def3268b5c6077d4ea7a5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/19fc8afd/uploads/origins/8899fa16-0b6f-4183-ad7f-8369c4f06134?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4d1c291df79def3268b5c6077d4ea7a5, https://si.imgix.net/19fc8afd/uploads/origins/8899fa16-0b6f-4183-ad7f-8369c4f06134?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=86fbff3bec168ea313a1decbd81ee88d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/19fc8afd/uploads/origins/8899fa16-0b6f-4183-ad7f-8369c4f06134?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0ad106e1e011daa322b3810591598a80 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/71", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/553c7a2b/uploads/origins/0981f275-70be-4328-ba18-be44715f5de1?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a46ba506bbdcd7af0956b549172962a7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/553c7a2b/uploads/origins/0981f275-70be-4328-ba18-be44715f5de1?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a46ba506bbdcd7af0956b549172962a7, https://si.imgix.net/553c7a2b/uploads/origins/0981f275-70be-4328-ba18-be44715f5de1?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d9be06becca46d9ca7d407501dce9579 2x, https://si.imgix.net/553c7a2b/uploads/origins/0981f275-70be-4328-ba18-be44715f5de1?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2f8110539a523dd1ed1a4e4748ee54d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello~!Nice to meet you!\n\nThank you for your appeal!\nI'm very happy to receive an appeal from you!\n\nSorry if my English is weird🥲💦\n\nthank you for watching my character!\nI'm very happy💕\n\nI would like you to draw my character.\n\nPlease draw the character in the URL below in a way that is easy for you to draw!\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/870d57vrv60kkgj6hywsn/2024-07-05-19-07-42-1.png?rlkey=yuj778pktte3v9byw7782egia&st=es7ojkiu&dl=0\n\nI'm really looking forward to it😘", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/70", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dbbb895f/uploads/origins/e9057d6f-7d16-434b-893b-35071735fad7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=73088cf728ebb80a6341a2fd5f3fbdd3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dbbb895f/uploads/origins/e9057d6f-7d16-434b-893b-35071735fad7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=73088cf728ebb80a6341a2fd5f3fbdd3, https://si.imgix.net/dbbb895f/uploads/origins/e9057d6f-7d16-434b-893b-35071735fad7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e233c6dfc8c4ea6f9d1553765125e8fb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dbbb895f/uploads/origins/e9057d6f-7d16-434b-893b-35071735fad7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=734df2d740989cf766dbe45cad085aed 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！サイトを見ていて、あなたのスケブを見つけたんです！\n\n元気で明るいあなたのスタイルで描かれた私のウサギを見てみたいです！\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/pf02abh9clmfsbg6azxik/ANhBWJXU2-JEu5bqU6dtrCs?rlkey=txg5jxcz5ws9smqfvjtzcenr6&st=qrudsnvm&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/69", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/127fa483/uploads/origins/0371aceb-77b0-47f0-a5f8-600a14448f82?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=570210cc9f9a60cc1143fa150c7607ef", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/127fa483/uploads/origins/0371aceb-77b0-47f0-a5f8-600a14448f82?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=570210cc9f9a60cc1143fa150c7607ef, https://si.imgix.net/127fa483/uploads/origins/0371aceb-77b0-47f0-a5f8-600a14448f82?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f87d8261c23b1e0cf827ebb3b2507eec 2x, https://si.imgix.net/127fa483/uploads/origins/0371aceb-77b0-47f0-a5f8-600a14448f82?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cdb353f89dd53f79c1d2de3898d1d5b2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたのアニメーションが大好きです^_^ 私の2人のキャラクターを一緒に描いていただけませんか？ゲーム「Destiny 2」のキャラクターです！\n\n最初のキャラクターはハーピーです！彼らはVexと呼ばれるエイリアンロボットを研究している科学者です。研究の結果、体の一部が機械の部品になってしまった。\n\nアート：https://toyhou.se/21421484.harpy\n\n2人目のキャラクターはアズリエル！彼は熟練したファイターであり、ファッションモデルでもある。その素晴らしい実力から、とても人気があり、自信家で自惚れが強い。\n\nアート：https://toyhou.se/21382601.azriel\n\n一緒に冒険したり、いろいろな惑星を探検したりすることが多い。アズリエルがハーピーに見せびらかすさまざまな衣装を描いてほしい！衣装の画像は、各参考フォルダにあります。ヘルメットをかぶっていても、かぶっていなくてもどちらでも構いませんので、お好きなように描いてください。よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-WQM7Cv4sachrb2-4tE4eGN60QBNj0ZK", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/68", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0b81ca82/uploads/origins/8aa71001-1662-4b36-bfef-95109101a223?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=793468c7dc812b2ecc8a927d594eeae4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0b81ca82/uploads/origins/8aa71001-1662-4b36-bfef-95109101a223?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=793468c7dc812b2ecc8a927d594eeae4, https://si.imgix.net/0b81ca82/uploads/origins/8aa71001-1662-4b36-bfef-95109101a223?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4343934a9fe81b12d257578eef735b1e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0b81ca82/uploads/origins/8aa71001-1662-4b36-bfef-95109101a223?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b25462c2799df848e2107a7fd59352ca 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちはこんにちは！あなたの作風は可愛らしいわ。私と友達のオリジナルキャラクターをリクエストしたいわ！\n\n[1】シルヴィ｜186cm\n陰気で情けない男。非常に気性が荒く、過剰反応しやすい。海老原の命令には素直に従うが、嫌々ながら聞いている。海老原に対してはツンデレ。\n[2】海老原／♀／150cm\nおっとりとした不良っぽい性格のエビちゃん。やりたい放題でシルヴィを威張る。シルヴィにとってはクーデレ。\n怪獣と戦うためにメイドや執事として働く囚人でもある。蛯原はファイター／DPSであり、シルヴィは戦闘中に彼女が非常に無謀であるため、攻撃から彼女を守る。彼らは互いに敵対しながらも、お互いを深く思いやる。そんな2人だが、互いに協力し合っている。\n\nどうぞ自由に描いてください！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_BOOftsWg1XaXxFM48y5tVUYXlclWeSM?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/67", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6d71d984/uploads/origins/c868ab6c-cb0a-4995-8b26-92e3036126c5?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2b2baa4eb21332aa010327478b40cfa1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6d71d984/uploads/origins/c868ab6c-cb0a-4995-8b26-92e3036126c5?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2b2baa4eb21332aa010327478b40cfa1, https://si.imgix.net/6d71d984/uploads/origins/c868ab6c-cb0a-4995-8b26-92e3036126c5?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29edd305c7aec83afbb96d952eb2f6df 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6d71d984/uploads/origins/c868ab6c-cb0a-4995-8b26-92e3036126c5?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b774fff278b468bfdcb9fb9e9eeefba1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi I'd received your appeal message a few months ago and after seeing your extremely cute works on skeb, yes I would love to request to see my favorite character in your adorable chibi style.\n\nHowever just need to remind at first that this is not my own character ,  so sorry to bother if you were only willing to do original characters.\n\nIf it’s ok for you to do non original characters , I would love to request for my favorite character \"Arisa Matsuda\", an idol who loves idols,  from series of \"The idol m@ster Million Live\" . She is usually too energetic and a bit silly when it comes to anything related to idols. \n\nI'd left an unofficial wiki site url with more description and all official card illustrations in the game. Feel free to choose any clothes and scene you like if you are willing to accept this request. \n\nThanks for reading through this request!\n\nhttps://project-imas.wiki/Arisa_Matsuda", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/66", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/05cefb5f/uploads/origins/478fb1dd-e906-44ea-9182-f23b716d87f7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1db5db94304e7a21953fe19b0bfbaa96", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/05cefb5f/uploads/origins/478fb1dd-e906-44ea-9182-f23b716d87f7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1db5db94304e7a21953fe19b0bfbaa96, https://si.imgix.net/05cefb5f/uploads/origins/478fb1dd-e906-44ea-9182-f23b716d87f7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2c33feb4298db7bd0ac9c187856e91f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/05cefb5f/uploads/origins/478fb1dd-e906-44ea-9182-f23b716d87f7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14270dc96e505d377c0cedf43569f300 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！前回の作品がとても気に入ったので、エステルとそのパートナー、エラの作品をもう一枚お願いします！彼らは同じ魔法アカデミーに通っていました。\n\nエラはまじめで近寄りがたい性格ですが、エステルが近くにいるとすぐに打ち解け、エステルに愛情を注ぐうちにおどけた性格になります。彼女は猫に変身する能力を持っているため、エステルは黒猫を飼っていると多くの人に思われている。エステルはエラに好意を抱いており、溺愛するのが好きだ。本人は気づいていないが、エラはエステルをとてもかわいがっており、知らない人が近づくとヒスを起こす。\n\n学校では、二人は一緒に演劇部に所属しており、エラは衣装部の部長だったため、残された学校生活の多くを一緒に過ごした。エラのエステルに対する恋愛感情が報われるのは、卒業から数年後、彼が余命いくばくもないことが分かってからである。\n\n二人のテーマは、脚本、花、星、そして時間である。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1qPWp2MoM15THW30HrqYX7ufzy0RT0msa?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/65", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/16754fbc/uploads/origins/b73edcef-607b-4f6c-a87e-9bb2f8dd7f5b?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3cbbbca16d8063cd2d20fac13c67ccf4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/16754fbc/uploads/origins/b73edcef-607b-4f6c-a87e-9bb2f8dd7f5b?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3cbbbca16d8063cd2d20fac13c67ccf4, https://si.imgix.net/16754fbc/uploads/origins/b73edcef-607b-4f6c-a87e-9bb2f8dd7f5b?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d9c158b5d6c91f089d0c53329a1766b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/16754fbc/uploads/origins/b73edcef-607b-4f6c-a87e-9bb2f8dd7f5b?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e566fb1e80f70dff5dd582911ce0e39 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "あなたの絵が大好きなので、お邪魔しに来ました。体型の違いはなく、2人の小さな男の子が交流している様子を描いていただきたいです。\nできれば以下の作品の感じを参考に描いていただきたいです。https://skeb.jp/@Poe_M_Art/works/57\n\n\n量が足りない場合は、再度送ってもら