ed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/61", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b0185261/uploads/origins/c7a02fff-356e-4fd9-83fe-8773c80020aa?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8275d6776fcc205be580bccd4f7bdca", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b0185261/uploads/origins/c7a02fff-356e-4fd9-83fe-8773c80020aa?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8275d6776fcc205be580bccd4f7bdca, https://si.imgix.net/b0185261/uploads/origins/c7a02fff-356e-4fd9-83fe-8773c80020aa?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59c6e3856a5b162d48b59b003c7a29a7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b0185261/uploads/origins/c7a02fff-356e-4fd9-83fe-8773c80020aa?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47f29b55f19cf10143e51b1422115348 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, your SD art is very cute! I would like to request something similar to this previous work  ↓\nskeb.jp/@Poe_M_Art/works/45\nIf the price didn't match, feel free to appeal for the correct amount\n\nCHARACTERS : It's a teddy bear family!🐻🏠❤️🌈🍳🎨💕\n🌹ROSE → Strict and perfectionist woman. She excels at cooking. She hates a messy house. She is scary when she gets angry. But Rose loves her kids very much.\n🎨 JAKE → Gentle and kind man. He is a good painter. He likes to teach how to draw and make paper crafts. But he is very clumsy and bad at cooking. He often get the house messy\nThey are the caretaker of the 4 bear kids. Please include the 4 kids if possible!\n\nFeel free draw anything that comes to mind when you see this bear family. 🐻🏠\nI usually love theme like \"Daily Activity at Home\" and colorful things! Cooking, eat, play, draw together, Jake reads storybook for the kids,  etc\nThank you for considering this request💓\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/12744479.pabear/gallery?key=W9JIDuMYPB5mxKW\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DQ8lpLgapNj7zW47Tg0AsMpVgqAqrLWV?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/60", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2cc4fda4/uploads/origins/6bfb7c83-c7f6-4dc6-8cf9-8052bf756081?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9815607ecddff08bea184c295b99841a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2cc4fda4/uploads/origins/6bfb7c83-c7f6-4dc6-8cf9-8052bf756081?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9815607ecddff08bea184c295b99841a, https://si.imgix.net/2cc4fda4/uploads/origins/6bfb7c83-c7f6-4dc6-8cf9-8052bf756081?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=16bec80d411b85178cfe110e0557804c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2cc4fda4/uploads/origins/6bfb7c83-c7f6-4dc6-8cf9-8052bf756081?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=687ef53585e185cd9906a80bbf8bb149 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "老師您好，第一次看到您的作品就喜歡上了很豐富的元素畫面安排跟動態設計。\n所以想來委託您畫自己家的OC，角色性格是元氣但是不失氣質的黑肉女生。\n\n可以參考的元素有：\n黑藍色粉蝶花 ／黑色兔子／星星／月亮／古書／沾水筆\n\n希望成品可以提供透明背景的圖檔，先謝謝老師了！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1VlvhSLZct-0H-_qGEqzT-lQW--JxbRPl/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Poe_M_Art/works/59", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/95e8fb28/uploads/origins/a2b50d01-3414-43c2-ab45-dc16890bf7f7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1255a268230475b97be00ee74dcb0265", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/95e8fb28/uploads/origins/a2b50d01-3414-43c2-ab45-dc16890bf7f7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1255a268230475b97be00ee74dcb0265, https://si.imgix.net/95e8fb28/uploads/origins/a2b50d01-3414-43c2-ab45-dc16890bf7f7?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fc4c2e0aa